{"id":70525,"date":"2026-10-23T09:04:01","date_gmt":"2026-10-23T08:04:01","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70525"},"modified":"2026-10-23T09:14:25","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T08:14:25","slug":"trail-da-povoa-de-varzim","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-da-povoa-de-varzim\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail da P\u00f3voa de Varzim 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail da P\u00f3voa de Varzim 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail da P\u00f3voa de Varzim 2027<\/strong> (10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 TPV) realiza-se no dia <strong>24 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (domingo), com centro nevr\u00e1lgico no <strong>Parque Desportivo Alberto Silva<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Navais<\/strong>, no concelho da <strong>P\u00f3voa de Varzim<\/strong> (distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>). Esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o comemorativa do d\u00e9cimo anivers\u00e1rio convida-te a descobrir os trilhos rurais e naturais do norte do munic\u00edpio poveiro.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O evento \u00e9 constitu\u00eddo por tr\u00eas vertentes que atravessam caminhos florestais, agr\u00edcolas e zonas costeiras da regi\u00e3o: o <strong>Trail Longo<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto<\/strong> e uma <strong>Caminhada<\/strong> de cariz n\u00e3o competitivo. Os quil\u00f3metros exatos e o desn\u00edvel acumulado de cada percurso da 10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o ser\u00e3o oficializados pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o aquando da publica\u00e7\u00e3o do regulamento de 2027.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>Centro Desportivo e Cultural de Navais (CDCN)<\/strong>, em parceria com a empresa municipal Varzim Lazer, a Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Agu\u00e7adoura e Navais e a C\u00e2mara Municipal da P\u00f3voa de Varzim, o evento celebra uma d\u00e9cada de conv\u00edvio desportivo e promo\u00e7\u00e3o do atletismo na regi\u00e3o. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgb